  "The authors used convolutional layers so that a translation model could process more input positions at the same time.": "作者使用卷积层，使翻译模型能同时处理更多输入位置。",
  "The parser labeled extra sentences itself, then trained on those automatically produced labels.": "句法分析器先自行标注额外句子，再用自动生成的标注继续训练。",
  "The model used several sets of attention weights to capture different parts of a sentence in its numerical representation.": "模型用多组注意力权重生成句子的数值表示，以捕捉句中的不同部分。",
  "The method splits rare words into smaller pieces that can also appear in other words, giving the translator reusable units.": "这种方法把罕见词拆成较小片段，这些片段也可能出现在其他词中，翻译模型因此能复用它们。",
  "Each token attends to a selected set of positions, which reduces the cost of processing a long document.": "每个词元只对选中的一部分位置计算注意力，因而能降低处理长文档的成本。",
  "Anthropic describes the values and behavior it aims to develop in Claude.": "Anthropic 说明它希望 Claude 具备哪些价值取向、表现出哪些行为。",
  "Carbon is the parent model from which Neon was adapted. Its card documents the starting architecture, data and infrastructure.": "Neon 由基础模型 Carbon 调整而来。Carbon 的模型卡介绍了起始架构、数据和基础设施。",
  "HealthBench Professional evaluates assistance with expert clinical tasks using scoring criteria developed with clinicians.": "HealthBench Professional 用临床专业人员参与制定的评分标准，评测模型协助处理专业临床任务的能力。",
